          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_health_a_02",
      "hash64": "AA92AD6193547C4F",
      "text": "今天哪里不舒服～？\\n你和你的宝可梦\\r\\n看起来都很有活力呀……[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_health_a_03",
      "hash64": "AA92AC6193547A9C",
      "text": "咦？\\n我好像从没见过你？[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_health_a_04a",
      "hash64": "2BB1BECD5888CF18",
      "text": "这样啊～\\n原来你刚刚转学进来呀～[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_health_a_04b",
      "hash64": "2BB1C1CD5888D431",
      "text": "哎呀哎呀，\\n这种玩法现在已经不流行啦……[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_health_a_05",
      "hash64": "AA92AA6193547736",
      "text": "啊～你是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n原来是传闻中的那孩子呀～[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_health_a_06",
      "hash64": "AA92A96193547583",
      "text": "听说你刚入学不久就掉下悬崖，\\n还和天星队硬碰硬之类的？\\r\\n你可是相～当火的话题人物哦。[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_health_a_07",
      "hash64": "AA92A861935473D0",
      "text": "啊，对了。\\n你开始寻宝了对吧～？[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_health_a_08",
      "hash64": "AA92B76193548D4D",
      "text": "要是在外面遇到有趣的事，\\n就来医务室告诉我吧～[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_health_a_09",
      "hash64": "AA92B66193548B9A",
      "text": "因为呀，我很闲嘛～\\n我不负责上课，\\r\\n来这里的又都是翘课的学生……[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_health_a_10",
      "hash64": "AA8F29619351662C",
      "text": "那就拜托啦～\\n我们说好了哦～[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
